2 CONT Daniel I of Galicia or Daniel Romanovych or Danylo Halytskyi (Ukrainian: Данило I Галицький, Danylo Halytskyi; 1201–1264) was King of Galicia (Halych) (1205–1255), Peremyshl (1211), and Volodymyr (1212–1231). He was crowned by a p
2 CONC apal archbishop in Dorohychyn 1253 as the 1st King of Ruthenia (1253–1264).
2 CONT --------------------
