2 CONT      Dietrich III, Graf von Hohnstein-Heringen-Tonna was born circa 1281 at of Hohnstein, Sachsen, Prussia. He married Elizabeth von Waldeck, daughter of Otto III, Count of Waldeck and Sophia von Hesse, between 1305 and 1310.1,4 D
2 CONC ietrich III, Graf von Hohnstein-Heringen-Tonna died between 29 September 1329 and 4 May 1330.1,4 \
2 CONT Family Elizabeth von Waldeck b. c 1281, d. a 24 Oct 1371
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	 Ulric III, Graf von Honstein-Kelbra-Morungen+ d. a 11 Sep 1414 Elisabeth von Honstein+4 d. c 4 Apr 1380 Heinrich von Honstein5 d. bt 26 Jul 1358 - 23 Jun 1360 Otto von Honstein5 d. a 1315 Bernhard von Honstein5 d. a 1315
2 CONC  Ludwig von Honstein5 d. a 1378 Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen+ b. c 1306, d. 1379 (Miss) von Honstein+ b. bt 1310 - 1315, d. a 1347
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. I/3, Tafel 326. [S5933] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 319, 385. [S11582] CD-ROM: Nobility of the Holy 
2 CONC Roman Empire and Other European Nobility, by GenQuest. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 92. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 92.
