2 CONC imburg  her mother was r Sophie Saarbrücken .....; Gerard van Limburg, heer van Horne en Wassenberg Possibly HER ONLY SON .....; Judith von Limburg; Maria von Limburg her mother was   Sophie Saarbrücken ...... Macharius von Limbur
2 CONC g his mother was Sophie Saarbrücken 
2 CONT
