2 CONT >>When Otto VI von Arnshaugk Lobdeburg was born about 1220, in Crimmitschau, Kreis  Zwickau, Saxony, Germany, his father, Hartmann III. Von Lobdenburg, was 31 and his mother, Christina von Meißen, was 32. He married Hedwig von Sch
2 CONC warzburg-Blankenburg V Count of Schwarzburg-Blanenburg about 1248, in Crimmitschau, Kreis  Zwickau, Saxony, Germany. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 2 July 1289, in Germany, at the age of 70.
