2 CONC 260, divorced after 1276) as his first wife, VALDEMAR Birgersson King of Sweden [Folkunge], son of BIRGER Magnusson Jarl and Regent of Sweden [Folkungaätten] & his first wife Ingeborg of Sweden ([1237]-Nyköping Castle 26 Dec 1302)
2 CONC .'''
