1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jutta von Hadmersleben=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Bodo von Hadmersleben and Irmgard von Beichlingen-Lohra 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Heinrich III, Graf & Herr von Stolberg''' was born circa 1242 at of Stolberg, Mansfeld-Südharz, Saxony-Anhalt, Germany; He may have been son of his father's 2nd wife. He married Jutta circa 1270.4 Heinrich III, Graf 
2 CONC & Herr von Stolberg married Jutta von Hadmersleben, daughter of Bodo von Hadmersleben and Irmgard von Beichlingen, after 29 July 1306 at of Stolberg, Sachsen, Prussia.1,2 Heinrich III, Graf & Herr von Stolberg died between 22 Augu
2 CONC st 1329 and 29 August 1331
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Friedrich 'the Elder' zu Stolberg,'''d. 12 Sep 1322
2 CONT * '''Bodo zu Stolberg,'''d. 3 Nov 1356
2 CONT * '''Friedrich 'the Younger' zu Stolberg,''' d. a 1347
2 CONT * '''Luitgard zu Hakeborn,'''d. 19 Dec 1353
2 CONT * '''Otto, Count of Stolberg,'''+ b. c 1310, d. bt 24 Nov 1337 - 10 Jan 1341
2 CONT * '''Heinrich XI, Graf von Stolberg,''' b. c 1320, d. 13 Dec 1377
2 CONT
