2 CONC r his descendants, The house of Tver, see HERE
2 CONT     * E7. Konstantin, Pr of Dmitrov and Galich (1246-55), +spring 1255; his issue was the house of Galich
2 CONT           o F1. Daniil, +1280; m.N, a dau.of Fedor "Cherniy" of Yaroslav (+1299)
