2 CONC based has not been identified.  According to another table in Europäische Stammtafeln[875], the wife of Moys de Dáró was Ielisaveta Rostislavna of Galich, widow firstly of Mihail II Asen Tsar of the Bulgarians and secondly of Kolo
2 CONC man II Tsar of the Bulgarians, daughter of Rostislav Mikhailovich ex-Grand Prince of Kiev, ex-Prince of Galich, Ban of Mačva & his wife Anna of Hungary.  '''She became a nun as SABINA'''.  m MOYS de Dáró, Judge of the Kumans (-end
2 CONC  1280).  Palatine of Hungary, Gespan of Sopron.]  One child:  
