2 CONC emely unusual for a mother and daughter to bear the same name, unless the mother's name was monasticIsaac's wife may have been a member of the Palaiologos family. A possible foreign origin is also given to her due to having the sa
2 CONC me name as her daughter. Their third child was born in 1182 or 1183 and she was dead or divorced by 1185, when Isaac remarried. Their children were:
