2 CONT Michael of Chernigov From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Numerous Russian princely families, such as the Dolgorukov, Volkonsky, Repnin, and Gorchakov, claimed descent from Mikhail of Chernigov. By his wife Maria Romanovna of Galicia and Volynia, Michael had several children, including: 
2 CONC Rostislav Mikhailovich, ban of Slavonia and Machva (1225–1262) Roman Mikhailovich, prince of Briansk, died 1288 Mstislav Mikhailovich, prince of Karachev and Zvenigorod Semën Mikhailovich, prince of Glukhov and Novosil' Yury Mikha
2 CONC ilovich, prince of Torusa
