1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Bernhard Graf von Regenstein-Blankenburg''' was born circa 1390 in Brake, Lippe, Germany. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-71747168 Ulrich Graf von Regenstein-Blankenburg] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-7174716
2 CONC 9 Katharine zur Lippe]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746152 Agnes Schwarzburg-Leutenberg] on August 9, 1414. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-71744911 Katharina von Regenstein, Gräfin, Gräfin von
2 CONC  Barby Mühlingen]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746164 Bernhard V (lV) von Regenstein und Blankenburg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746156 Ulrich, Count Of Regenstein]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746158 Elisabeth, Coun
2 CONC tess Of Regenstein]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746160 Barbara, Countess Of Regenstein]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-71746162 Ursule, Countess Of Regenstein]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1423. 
2 CONT ----
