2 CONT Hildegunde was born about 1212, the daughter of Eberhard von Eberstein IV (graf von Eberstein) and Adelheid von Sayn. The place is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband was Dietrich von Katzenelnbogen IV (graf von Katzenelnbogen). They were married, but the date and place have not been found. Their six known children were Adelheid (?-1288), Eberhard (?-?), Dietrich (?-1276), Katharina
2 CONC  (?-<1265), Gerhard (?-1279/80) and Heinrich (?-1232).
