2 CONT * http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Botho_zu_Stolberg_der_%C3%84ltere
2 CONT * https://memim.com/bodo-vii-count-of-stolberg-wernigerode.html
2 CONT * https://geneee.org/botho/zu+stolberg?lang=en
2 CONT * https://memim.com/bodo-vii-count-of-stolberg-wernigerode.html
2 CONT * https://www.wikiwand.com/en/County_of_Wernigerode
2 CONT * https://nl.qaz.wiki/wiki/Bodo_VII,_Count_of_Stolberg-Wernigerode
2 CONT * http://www.europeanheraldry.org/germany/princely-houses/house-nassau/ottonian-line/
2 CONT * https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stolberg-Wernigerode
2 CONT * https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Stolberg
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Botho Graf zu Stolberg-Wernigerode: Geschichte des Hauses Stolberg, George Adalbert von Mülverstedt, Magdeburg 1883, p. 171-289. 
2 CONT * The Peerage - https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/ui24.htm#a652
