2 CONT *'''Duke of Saxony, Angria and Westphalia colloquially: Duke of Saxe-Lauenburg''
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxe-Ratzeburg-Lauenburg''' Reign  1368–1401
2 CONT * >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-II-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg/6000000001963120254 Eric II] '''Joint successors:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-IV-Herzog-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/6000000001951835678 
2 CONC Eric IV], [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-Saxony/6000000006727821465 Eric V] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Johann-Saxony/6000000006727821472 John IV](Eric IV inherited Saxe-Bergedorf-Mölln from Eric III and then shared his rei
2 CONC gn in the reunited duchy with his sons.)
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxe-Lauenburg (Created by merging Saxe-Bergedorf-Mölln and Saxe-Ratzeburg-Lauenburg)''' Joint reign 1401–1411
2 CONT * >'''Separate predecessors:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-IV-Herzog-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/6000000001951835678 Eric IV] (in Saxe-Ratzeburg-Lauenburg) and Eric III (in Saxe-Bergedorf-Mölln) '''Joint successors:''' 
2 CONC [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-Saxony/6000000006727821465 Eric V] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Johann-Saxony/6000000006727821472 John IV] (joint ruler
2 CONT * http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erich_IV._(Sachsen-Lauenburg)
2 CONT * https://familypedia.wikia.org/wiki/Erich_IV._von_Sachsen-Lauenburg_(1354-1412)
2 CONT
