1 OCCU Governor of Lusatia (Lausitz, Lužice) (1468-1492) historical region in Central Europe, current Germany, guvernér Lužice
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sternberg_(Adelsgeschlecht) wikipedia] ''(German google translation)'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Governor in [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lusatia Lusatia] (Lausitz, Lužice is current Germany) was appointed Papal legate to the bailiff of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oberlausitz Upper Lusatia]. The Office was later confirmed 
2 CONC by Könnig ''Matthias Corvinus''. As leader of the Lusatian made ​​to combine with his subordinates because of his autocratic rule and unpopular with inactivity was deposed by ''King Matthias'' 1471. From his father he inherited [h
2 CONC ttp://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gr%C3%BCnberg Grünberg], [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%C5%99e%C5%A1%C5%A5 Třešť], Moravia and half of  [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doma%C5%BElice Domažlice] (Taus), Bohemia he sold the 1478. With hi
2 CONC s brother he took [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hora%C5%BE%C4%8Fovice Horažďovice], Bohemia. From 1479 he owned [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krom%C4%9B%C5%99%C3%AD%C5%BE Kroměříž], Moravia. 1490 he obtained sovereignty over [http
2 CONC ://de.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Du%C5%A1niky&action=edit&redlink=1 Duschnik] =same as [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Du%C5%A1n%C3%ADky Dušníky''], Bohemia? With his wife '''Elizabeth von Gera''', whom he married in 1478, he h
2 CONC ad 6 sons.
