2 CONT Otto's sons with Heilika of Lengenfeld-Pettendorf were Otto I, the first Wittelsbach duke of Bavaria and Conrad of Wittelsbach, archbishop of Mainz and Salzburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto IV, Count of Wittelsbach (c. 1083-4 August 1156) was a descendant of Count Otto II of Scheyern and Richgard of Weimar-Istrien. Otto entitled himself after Wittelsbach Castle near Aichach from 1116 onwards, served Henry V, Hol
2 CONC y Roman Emperor and was Count palatine of Bavaria since 1120.
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto was married with Heilika of Lengenfeld-Pettendorf, a daughter of Count Friedrich III of Pettendorf-Lengenfeld-Hopfenohe. Their sons were Otto I, the first Wittelsbach duke of Bavaria and Conrad of Wittelsbach, archbishop of M
2 CONC ainz and Salzburg.
2 CONT
