2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto IV van Wittelsbach (-1156) was een zoon van Otto I van Scheyern-Wittelsbach. Hij was graaf van Wittelsbach en paltsgraaf van Beieren. Otto II van Wittelsbach was gehuwd met Heilika van Pettendorf, en kreeg volgende kinderen:
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto I van Beieren(1117-1183) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederik (-1198) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ulrich II (- 1160) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hedwig (-1174), in 1152 gehuwd met Berthold V van Andechs, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto IV (-1189), gehuwd met Benedicta van Moosburg 
2 CONT
2 CONT Koenraad (- 1200), kardinaal, aartsbisschop van Mainz en van Salzburg, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelheid, gehuwd met Otto III van Stefling, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto IV, Count of Wittelsbach (c. 1083-4 August 1156) was a descendant of Count Otto II of Scheyern and Richgard of Weimar-Istrien. Otto entitled himself after Wittelsbach Castle near Aichach from 1116 onwards, served Henry V, Hol
2 CONC y Roman Emperor and was Count palatine of Bavaria since 1120.
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto was married with Heilika of Lengenfeld-Pettendorf, a daughter of Count Friedrich III of Pettendorf-Lengenfeld-Hopfenohe. Their sons were Otto I, the first Wittelsbach duke of Bavaria and Conrad of Wittelsbach, archbishop of M
2 CONC ainz and Salzburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://genealogy.euweb.cz/wittel/wittel1.html#HO4
2 CONT =Wittelsbach=
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Otto I von Scheyern, +4.12.1072/1078; 1m: Haziga von Diessen; 2m: Hadagunda von Scheyern (dau.of N by a dau.of Hartwig II Pfgf of Bavaria); He had issue: 
2 CONT * ...
2 CONT * A3. [2m.] Gf Ekkehart I von Scheyern, +by 1088/before 11.5.1094; m.Richgard of Carniola, dau.of Ulrich von Weimar-Orlamünde 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT ** B2. Gf Otto I von Scheyern, Gf von Wittelsbach 1115, Pfgf of Bavaria (1110-20), +1123, bur Indersdorf; m.N, a dau.of Eberhard von Ratzenhofen 
2 CONT *** C1. '''Otto II, Gf von Wittelsbach, Pfgf in Bayern 1121, +4.8.1156, bur Ensdorf'''; m.Heilika von Lengenfeld-Hopfenohe-Pettendorf (+1170, bur Ensdorf)
2 CONT **** ...
2 CONT **** D5. Otto IV, Pfgf von Wittelsbach, +1189, bur Indersdorf; m.Benedikta von Moosburg (?), dau.of Gf Mangold von Wörth 
2 CONT ***** E1. Udalschalk, fl 1158/72 
2 CONT ***** E2. Otto V, Pfgf von Wittelsbach, +k.1209, bur Indersdorf 
2 CONT ***** E3. Agnes, fl 1172/1219; 1m: Gerhard I, Wildgf in Kyrburg; 2m: Gf Albrecht IV von Everstein 
2 CONT ***** E4. Heilika, +after 1189; m.before 1176 Mgve Konrad Otto of Moravia, Duke of Bohemia (+9.9.1191) 
2 CONT ***** E5. Euphemia, fl 1182
2 CONT **** ...
