2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p11395.htm#i113946 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/D/per_page.php?id=520968 Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adelheid_von_Mei%C3%9Fen Wikipedia]
2 CONT *[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEISSEN.htm#Adelheiddied1211 Medlands]
