2 CONT * This Adelheid who was married to ADOLF [II] Graf von Berg, son of ADOLF [I] Graf von Berg & his wife Adelheid von Laufen isn’t the daugter of Dietrich II count of Cleves who died in 1118.  Wikipedia states that he was married to
2 CONC  Adelheid of Cleves (von Kleve), a daughter of Dietrich II count of Cleves who died in 1118, but in Project MedLands under Saxony Nobility clearly states he was married to Adelheid Graf von Cappenberg, who was the daughter of GOTT
2 CONC FRIED [I] von Cappenberg (-killed in battle 1106) and his wife  BEATRIX von Hildrizhausen, daughter of HEINRICH Graf von Hildrizhausen & his wife Beatrix von Schweinfurt (-[1115/22]).
