1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p4038.htm#i40373 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/D/per_page.php?id=1563825 Geneall]
