2 CONC ughter of the Grand Duke of Kiev Rostislav Mstislavich. Agafya was the second wife of Oleg Svyatoslavich, prince of Novgorod-Seversky. According to one of the hypotheses, which is of an unscientific nature, she was the author of [
2 CONC https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Tale_of_Igor%27s_Campaign The Tale of Igor's Campaign].
