2 CONC r 1241)
2 CONT **B1. '''Rostislav, Pr of Novgorod (1229-30), Pr of Galitzia (1238), Pr of Lutzk (1239), Pr of Chernigov (1240-43), Ban of Serbian Machva, Ban of Slavonia, Tsar of Bulgaria, *1225, +1262'''; m.1243 Anna of Hungary (*1226/27 +after
