2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT a Polish princess and member of the House of Piast, and by her three marriages Queen consort of Sweden and Princess of the Principality of Minsk (now the capital and largest city in Belarus).
2 CONT  Richeza was the daughter of Bolesław III Wrymouth, Duke of Poland, by his second wife Salomea, daughter of Henry, Count of Berg. Tradition describes her as unusually beautiful.
