1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p644.htm#i19329 Anna of Plock1 Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 F, #19329, b. circa 1319, d. 16 February 1363 Father	Wenzel, Prince of Plock b. c 1293, d. 23 May 1336
