2 CONT      Anna of Plock was born circa 1319 at of Plock, Warszawa, Poland. She married Henry V, Duke of Sagan, son of Henry IV, Duke of Glogau & Sagan and Mechtild von Brandenburg, before 5 September 1337. Anna of Plock died on 16 Febr
