1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Agnes von Meißen born about 1280 died about 1325, daughter of Meinhard III. (V.) Burggraf von Meißen (born about 1246 died between 1289 and 1308) and N.N. von Lobdeburg-Arnshaugk (no dates available)
2 CONT married Albero III. (Albrecht) Burggraf von Leisnig.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT Sophie Burggräfin von Leisnig born 1298 died 1323, married Albrecht von Hackeborn (ca 1276 - ca 1323).
2 CONT Albero IV. (Albrecht) von Leisnig born about 1300 died 1349 alternatively 25 August 1340
2 CONT Meinher von Leisnig died after 1339
2 CONT Otto I. Burggraf von Leisnig died between 24 April and 19 August 1363
2 CONT Heinrich II. d.J. Burggraf von Leisnig died after 1346.
