2 CONT b)       '''  ALBRECHT [III] von Hohenberg''' (-after 25 Nov 1304).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 14 Feb 1300 which names "comiti Alberto filio comitis felicis recordationis Alberti…comitis de Hohinburg"[579].  
2 CONC "Burchardus de Honburch comes" named "fratruele nostro Alberto" in a charter dated 25 Nov 1304[580].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m [firstly] (Grüningen 1 Aug 1284) as her first husband, ---.   The Chronicon Sindelfingensis records the marriage 1 Aug 1284 “in castro Grúningen” of “comes Albertus de Hoinberch...filio suo”[581].  The name of Albrecht's first w
2 CONC ife is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT [m secondly (contract 9 Feb 1296) CLARA EUPHEMIA von Görz, daughter of ALBRECHT [II] Graf von Görz & his second wife Euphemia von Ortenburg.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
