1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Kraft III, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1,2
2 CONT Last Edited	7 Nov 2010
2 CONT '''M, #27619, b. circa 1315, d. 16 November 1371'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Kraft II, Count von Hohenlohe b. c 1288, d. 3 May 1344
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Adelheid von Württemberg b. c 1290, d. 13 Sep 1342
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT '''Kraft III, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim was born circa 1315 at of Weikersheim, Wuerttemberg, Germany. He married Anna von Leuchtenberg''', daughter of Ulric I, Landgraf von Leuchtenberg and Anna von Nürnberg, '''before 12 Mar
2 CONC ch 1340.1,2 Kraft III, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim died on 16 November 1371.'''1,2
2 CONT '''Family	Anna von Leuchtenberg''' d. 11 Jun 1390
2 CONT '''Children	'''
2 CONT *Albrecht I, Herr von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim+ d. 15 Jun 1429
2 CONT *Adelheid von Hohenlohe+3 d. 6 Nov 1370
2 CONT *Anna von Hohenlohe+4 d. 1 Jun 1434
2 CONT *Gottfried III, Herr von Hohenlohe in Weikersheim3 d. 13 Sep 1413
2 CONT *Ulrich von Weikersheim3 d. 6 Dec 1407
2 CONT *Johann (Hans) von Weikersheim3 d. 23 Sep 1381
2 CONT *Friedrich von Weikersheim3 d. 14 Jan 1397
2 CONT *Georg von Weikersheim3 d. 8 Aug 1423
2 CONT *Kraft IV, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim+5,6 b. b 1351, d. 24 Nov 1399
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 3.
2 CONT 2. [S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 20-77.
2 CONT 3. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 3.
2 CONT 4. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 5.
2 CONT 5. [S11582] CD-ROM: Nobility of the Holy Roman Empire and Other European Nobility, by GenQuest.
2 CONT 6. [S11572] The Lineage and Ancestry of H.R.H. Prince Charles, Prince of Wales, by Gerald Paget, Vol. II, p. 284.
2 CONT From: https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p920.htm#i27619
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________
2 CONT ==Kraft III von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 
2 CONT '''M, #103050, d. 16 November 1371'''
2 CONT Last Edited=7 Jun 2004
2 CONT '''Kraft III von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim was the son''' of Kraft II Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim and Adelheid von Württemberg.1 '''He married Anna von Leuchtenberg''', daughter of Ulrich I Landgraf von Leuchtenberg and Anna von Zo
2 CONC llern, '''before 12 March 1340.1 He died on 16 November 1371.'''1
2 CONT '''He was a member of the House of Hohenlohe.1 He was also known as Kraft zu Möckmuhl as of 1345.1 He was also known as Kraft zu Wiedern as of 1362.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Kraft III von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim and Anna von Leuchtenberg'''
2 CONT 1. Kraft IV von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim+1 d. 1399
2 CONT 2. Gottfried III von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 13 Sep 1413
2 CONT 3. Ulrich von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 6 Dec 1407
2 CONT 4. Johann von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 23 Sep 1381
2 CONT 5. Albrecht I von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim+1 d. 15 Jun 1429
2 CONT 6. Friedrich von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 14 Jan 1397
2 CONT 7. Georg von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 8 Aug 1423
2 CONT 8. Anna von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 1 Jun 1434
2 CONT 9. Adelheid von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 22 Sep 1370
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S13] Detlev Schwennicke, editor, Europäische Stammtafeln: Stammtafeln zur Geschicht der Europäischen Staaten, Neue Folge: Band XVII (Frankfurt am Main, Germany: Vittorio Klostermann, 1998), tafel 3. Hereinafter cited as Europä
2 CONC ische Stammtafeln: Band XVII.
2 CONT From: https://www.thepeerage.com/p10305.htm#i103050
2 CONT
