2 CONT ==Albrecht I von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 
2 CONT '''M, #103734, d. 15 June 1429'''
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Jun 2008
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.02%
2 CONT '''Albrecht I von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim was the son''' of Kraft III von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim and Anna von Leuchtenberg.1 '''He married Elisabeth von Hanau''', daughter of Ulrich V Graf von Hanau, '''before 11 February 1413.1 He d
2 CONC ied on 15 June 1429.'''1
2 CONT '''He was a member of the House of Hohenlohe.1 He held the office of Canon of Mainz between 1388 and 1397.1 He held the office of Canon of Passau in 1390.1 He held the office of Canon of Trier between 1391 and 1409.1 He held the o
2 CONC ffice of Canon of Würzburg between 1391 and 1409. He was a priest between 1408 and 1412 at Öhringen, Germany'''G.1
2 CONT '''Children of Albrecht I von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim and Elisabeth von Hanau'''
2 CONT 1. Kraft V Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim+1 d. 31 Mar 1472
2 CONT 2. Anna von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 d. 8 Sep 1440
2 CONT 3. Adelheid von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1
2 CONT 4. Agneta von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1
2 CONT 5. Georg von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 b. 1417, d. 1470
2 CONT 6. Albrecht II Graf von Hohenlohe-Ziegenhain1 b. b 1429, d. 1490
2 CONT 7. Elisabeth von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim1 b. b 1429, d. 24 Dec 1488
2 CONT Citations
