2 CONT ==Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	7 Nov 2010
2 CONT '''M, #27621, b. 1368, d. after 27 October 1416'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Ulric IV, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg b. c 1334, d. bt 16 Sep 1380 - 14 Oct 1380
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Elisabeth von Wertheim b. 1347, d. 28 Feb 1378
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT '''Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg was born in 1368 at of Hanau, Hessen-Nassau, Prussia. A contract for the marriage of Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg and Elisabeth von Ziegenhain was signed on 3 April 1379.4 Ulric V, Cou
2 CONC nt von Hanau-Munzenberg married Elisabeth von Ziegenhain''', daughter of Godfrey VIII, Graf von Ziegenhain and Agnes von Brunswick, '''circa 19 February 1394.5,3 Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg died after 27 October 1416.'''5,
2 CONC 2
2 CONT '''Family	Elisabeth von Ziegenhain''' d. 1 Dec 1431
2 CONT '''Children	'''
2 CONT *Elisabeth von Hanau+ d. 25 May 1475
2 CONT *Agnes von Hanau d. 22 Nov 1446
2 CONT *Adelheid von Hanau d. a 13 Nov 1426
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S8160] Unknown author, Europaische Stammtafeln, by Isenburg, Vol. 16, chart 159.
2 CONT 2. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 31.
2 CONT 3. [S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 20-103.
2 CONT 4. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 31.
2 CONT 5. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVI, Tafel 159.
2 CONT From: https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p920.htm#i27621
2 CONT
