2 CONT      Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen was born circa 1268. He was the son of Albrecht I Herzog von Braunschweig and Adelheid de Montferrat.1 He married Rixa von Werle, daughter of Heinrich I Prinz von Werle and Rixa (
2 CONC ?), on 10 January 1284. He died on 22 September 1318.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen also went by the nick-name of Albrecht 'the Fat'.1 He was a member of the House of Guelph.1 He succeeded to the title of Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen in 1286.1 He succeeded t
2 CONC o the title of Herzog von Braunschweig in 1292.1 He gained the title of Herzog von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel in 1292.
