2 CONT Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #7675, b. circa 1388, d. 7 October 1444
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=3 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen was born circa 1388. He married Catherine von Braunschweig, daughter of Friedrich Herzog von Braunschweig and Anne von Sachsen, circa 1413. He died on 7 October 1444.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen gained the title of Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen and Catherine von Braunschweig
