2 CONC iti palatino Reni, duci Bawarie et…domine Mehthildi uxori eius…Romanorum regis filie", with the consent of "nostri fratris Friderici iunioris langravii", by charter dated 18 Nov 1282[838].  Teutonic Knight 1291/95. 
