2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna von SCHLESIEN-SAGAN Duchesse *Born about 1480 +Deceased in October 1541 , age at death: possibly 61 years old'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT *Johann II von SCHLESIEN-SAGAN , Duc de Sagan , born about 1435 , Deceased 22 September 1504 age at death: possibly 69 years old Married about 1461 to 
2 CONT *Katharina PRZEMYSLIDE , Duchesse , born in 1443 Deceased 14 April 1505 age at death: 62 years old
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses, children, grandchildren and great-grandchildren
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in January 1488 to Charles I de PODIEBRAD , Duc de Münsterberg, born 4 May 1476 , Deceased 21 May 1536 age at death: 60 years old (Parents : M Henri Ier de PODIEBRAD , Duc de Münsterberg 1448-1498  &  F Ursula von HOHENZOL
2 CONC LERN 1450-1508 ) with
2 CONT *F Ursula de PODIEBRAD 1505-1539  married in 1523 to Hieronymus von BIBERSTEIN  Seigneur de Sorau †1549  with
2 CONT **F Anna von BIBERSTEIN †1543  married to Christoph LOBKOWICZ , Seigneur de Bilin †1590  with :
2 CONT ***M Ulrich Felix LOBKOWICZ , Seigneur de Bilin †1604
2 CONT *M Henri II de PODIEBRAD , Duc de Münsterberg 1507-1548  married 12 November 1537 to Margarethe von MECKLENBURG-SCHWERIN 1515-1559  with
2 CONT **M Charles II de PODIEBRAD , Duc de Münsterberg 1545-1617  married 30 September 1585 to Elisabeth Magdalena von SCHLESIEN-LIEGNITZ , Duchesse 1562-1630  with :
2 CONT ***M Charles Frédéric de PODIEBRAD , Duc de Münsterberg-Oels 1593-1647
2 CONT ***F Sophie-Catherine de PODIEBRAD , Princesse de Münsterberg 1601-1659
2 CONT *F Hedwige de PODIEBRAD 1508-1531  married 9 January 1525 to Georg von HOHENZOLLERN , Margrave d'Ansbach 1484-1543  with
2 CONT **F Anna Maria von HOHENZOLLERN 1526-1589  married 24 February 1544 to Christoph von WÜRTTEMBERG , Herzog von Württemberg 1515-1568  with :
2 CONT ***M Eberhard von WÜRTTEMBERG 1545-1568
2 CONT ***F Hedwig von WÜRTTEMBERG 1547-1590
2 CONT ***F Isabella von WÜRTTEMBERG 1549-1592
2 CONT ***F Sabine von WÜRTTEMBERG 1549-1581
2 CONT ***F Eleonore von WÜRTTEMBERG , Herzogin von Württemberg 1552-1618
2 CONT ***M Ludwig von WÜRTTEMBERG , Herzog von Württemberg 1554-1593
2 CONT **F Sabina von HOHENZOLLERN 1529-1575  married in 1548 to Johann Georg l'Économe von HOHENZOLLERN , Kurfürst von Brandenburg 1525-1598  with :
2 CONT ***F Sophia von HOHENZOLLERN 1568-1622
