2 CONT
2 CONT Ludwig Graf zu Stolberg ( January 12 1505 in Stolberg (Harz) ; † September 1 1574 in Wertheim ) was a German Regent.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [Verbergen]
2 CONT
