2 CONT Albert I, Duke of Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert married in Passau after July 19, 1353, Margaret of Brieg from Silesia (1342/43 – 1386), and had seven children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina (c. 1361 – 1400, Hattem), married in Geertruidenberg in 1379 William I of Gelders and Jülich
2 CONT
2 CONT Johanna (c. 1362 – 1386), wife of Wenceslaus, King of the Romans
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (1363 – January 23, 1423, Dijon), married in Cambrai in 1385 John the Fearless
2 CONT
2 CONT William VI, Count of Holland (1365–1417)
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert II, Duke of Bavaria-Straubing (1369 – January 21, 1397, Kelheim)
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna Sophia (c. 1373 – November 15, 1410, Vienna), married on June 15, 1395 Albert IV, Duke of Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT John, Count of Holland (1374/76 – 1425), Bishop of Liège
