1 NOTE 429873840. Otto den Rike ALBRECHTSON was born in 1075. He was born about 1075. (15305) He was a Greve between 1080 and 1123 in Ballenstedt. He was a Hertug in 1111/12 in Sachsen. He was a hertug in 1111/12 in Sachsen. (15306) He d
2 CONC ied in 1123. He died on 9 Feb 1123.(15307) He was a Greve in 1983 in Ballenstedt.(15308) He was married to Elica MAGNUSDTR av Sachsen before 1095.
