2 CONC iepiscopo, cuius propinqua erat"[1605], undated but dated to [1182] from the context of other passages.  Philipp Archbishop of Köln confirmed the donation to Loccum by “neptis mea Adheleydis comitissa de Scowenburg” (with the cons
