1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hellicha_of_Wittelsbach
2 CONT ------
2 CONT - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BAVARIA.htm#Heilikadied1189
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         HEILIKA (-13 Aug after 1189).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  The necrology of Undensdorf records the death "Id Aug" of "Heilika ducisse Pohemie"[874].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (before 1176) KONRAD III OTTO Duke of Moravia, son of KONRAD II Duke of Moravia & his wife Maria of Serbia (-near Naples 9 Sep 1191).  He succeeded in 1189 as KONRAD I OTTO Duke of Bohemia.    
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://genealogy.euweb.cz/wittel/wittel1.html#HO4
2 CONT =Wittelsbach=
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Otto I von Scheyern, +4.12.1072/1078; 1m: Haziga von Diessen; 2m: Hadagunda von Scheyern (dau.of N by a dau.of Hartwig II Pfgf of Bavaria); He had issue: 
2 CONT * ...
2 CONT * A3. [2m.] Gf Ekkehart I von Scheyern, +by 1088/before 11.5.1094; m.Richgard of Carniola, dau.of Ulrich von Weimar-Orlamünde 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT ** B2. Gf Otto I von Scheyern, Gf von Wittelsbach 1115, Pfgf of Bavaria (1110-20), +1123, bur Indersdorf; m.N, a dau.of Eberhard von Ratzenhofen 
2 CONT *** C1. Otto II, Gf von Wittelsbach, Pfgf in Bayern 1121, +4.8.1156, bur Ensdorf; m.Heilika von Lengenfeld-Hopfenohe-Pettendorf (+1170, bur Ensdorf)
2 CONT **** ...
2 CONT **** D5. Otto IV, Pfgf von Wittelsbach, +1189, bur Indersdorf; m.Benedikta von Moosburg (?), dau.of Gf Mangold von Wörth 
2 CONT ***** E1. Udalschalk, fl 1158/72 
