2 CONT ***** E4. '''Heilika, +after 1189'''; m.before 1176 Mgve Konrad Otto of Moravia, Duke of Bohemia (+9.9.1191) 
2 CONT ***** E5. Euphemia, fl 1182
2 CONT **** ...
