2 CONT 6.         IOLANDA ([1215]-Huesca 12 Oct 1251).  The Crónica de San Juan de la Peña records the second marriage of Jaime I King of Aragon and "la filla del Rey de Vngria…Ardeura la qual depues huuo nombre Violant nieta del Emperad
2 CONC or de Constantin noble"[867].  She was known as VIOLANT in Catalonia.  The Anales Toledanos record the death “IV Non Oct” in 1251 of “Dña Yoles, Regina Aragonum”[868].  The Chronicle of the Hôtel de Ville de Montpellier records th
2 CONC e death in 1251 "D. Yoles regina Aragoniæ"[869].  The Thalamus de Montpellier records the death in Sep 1251 at Lérida of "la dona Yoles regina dAragon molher del rei Jacme"[870].  m (Barcelona 8 Sep 1235) as his second wife, don J
2 CONC AIME I "el Conquistador" King of Aragon, Conde de Barcelona, son of don PEDRO II King of Aragon & his wife Marie de Montpellier (Montpellier 1 Feb 1208-Valencia 27 Jul 1276, bur Poblet, monastery of Nuestra Señora). 
