2 CONT
2 CONT 3 Struggles for Halych 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 The Fifth Crusade 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 The Golden Bull and the Diploma Andreanum 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 Discords with his son 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 The Agreement of Bereg 
