2 CONT # Anna, (1226/1227 – after 3 July 1271), wife of Prince Rostislav of Mačva
2 CONT # Elisabeth, (1236 – 24 October 1271), wife of Henry XIII, Duke of Bavaria
2 CONT # Konstantia, (? – ?), wife of King Leo I of Halych
2 CONT # King Stephen V of Hungary, (before 18 October 1239 – 6 August 1272)
2 CONT # Saint Margaret, (27 January 1242 – 18 January 1271)
2 CONT # Ilona, (? – 16/17 June after 1303), wife of Bolesław the Pious Duke of Greater Poland
2 CONT # Duke Béla of Slavonia (c. 1245 – 1269)
2 CONT # ►Szabina, wife of Mózes (Majos/Majs/Mojs/Moys), Palatine of Hungary (? – 1280)[3][4][5]◄
