2 CONC ich in the Annalista Saxo[258].  Burggraf von Meissen.  Herr von Eilenburg.  Thietmar records the death of "Count Friedrich…in his burg Eilenburg", stating that he transferred Eilenburg to "his brother's son Dietrich" before he di
