2 CONT Conrad Landgraf von Landsberg
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #8936, d. circa 1050
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=14 Jun 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Conrad Landgraf von Landsberg was the son of Dietrich II Markgraf von Ostmark and Mathilde von Meißen. He died circa 1050, on a 17 January.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Conrad Landgraf von Landsberg gained the title of Markgraf von Landsberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Conrad Landgraf von Landsberg and Othilde von Katlenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Bertrade von Landsberg d. c 1145
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p894.htm#i8936
