2 CONT Hartmann II Graf von Lobdeburg Amshaugk, Circa 1190 - 1237
2 CONT Hartmann II Graf von Lobdeburg Amshaugk, II was born circa 1190, in birth place, to Hermann von Lobdeburg Burgau and Nn von Lobdeburg-Burgau (born von Böhmen-Mähren).
2 CONT Hartmann had 3 brothers: Hermann VI. von Lobdeburg-Leuchtenburg and 2 other siblings.
2 CONT Hartmann married '''Christine von Lobdeburg Amshaugk (born von Meißen)'''.
2 CONT Christine was born on month day 1190, in birth place.
2 CONT They had 6 children: Sophia Agnesia Lobdeburg, Anna Burggräfin von Meißen (born von Lobdeburg-Arnshaugk) and 4 other children.
2 CONT Hartmann passed away in 1237, at age 47 in death place.
