1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marriage (1): Sobeslav II of Bohemia circa 1173  Marriage (2): Conrad III von der Lausitz after 29 Jan 1180 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elisabeth_of_Greater_Poland,_Duchess_of_Bohemia http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/POLAND.htm#Elzbietadied1209
2 CONT
2 CONT MIESZKO of Poland, son of BOLESŁAW III "Krzywousty/Wrymouth" Prince of Poland & his second wife Salome von Berg-Schelklingen ([1126/27]-13 Mar 1202).  ... m firstly ([1136/40]) ELISABETH of Hungary, daughter of BÉLA II "the Blind"
2 CONC  King of Hungary & his wife Jelena of Serbia ([1128]-before 1155).  ... m secondly ([1151/54]) IEVDOKIA Iziaslavna, daughter of IZIASLAV II Mstislavich Grand Prince of Kiev & his second wife --- of Lithuania. ... Prince Mieszko & 
2 CONC his first wife had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         ODON ([1141/49]-20 Apr 1194).  ... m (after 1184) VIACHESLAVA Iaroslavna, daughter of IAROSLAV Vladimirkovich "Osmomysl" Prince of Galich & his first wife Olga Iurievna of Kiev (-after 1200). ... Prince Odon & his wife
2 CONC  had three children: 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT *2.         STEFAN . ... 
2 CONT *3.         WIERCHOSŁAWA LUDMILLA (before 1153-in Poland before 1211).  ...  m ([1167]) FERRY de Lorraine Sire de Bitsch, son of MATHIEU I Duke of Lorraine & his wife Berta [Judith] von Staufen (before 1152-7 Apr 1206).
2 CONT *4.         '''ELŹBIETA ([1152]-2 Apr 1209, bur Kloster Dobrilugk). ''' The Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum refers to, but does not name, the daughters of Mieszko III, naming (first in the list) "dux Boemorum Sobeslaus" as his son-in-
2 CONC law[284].  The Genealogica Wettinensis names "Elizabeth filiam Meseconis ducis Polonie, viduam Zibizlai ducis Bohemie" as wife of "Conradus marchio filius Dedonis"[285].  The Chronicon Montis Serreni names "Elizabeth marchionissa…
2 CONC soror Wlodizlai ducis" as wife of "Conradi marchionis" when recording her death "1209 IV Non Apr" and her burial "Doberluge"[286].  The Genealogica Wettinensis records the death in 1209 of "Elizabeth marchionissa"[287].  m firstly
2 CONC  ([1173/77]) SOBĚSLAV II Duke of Bohemia, son of SOBĚSLAV I UDALRICH Duke of the Bohemians & his wife Adelaida of Hungary (1128-29 Jan 1180).  m secondly KONRAD II von Landsberg Markgraf der Niederlausitz, son of DEDO V "der Feist
2 CONC e" Markgraf der Niederlausitz, Graf von Eilenburg [Wettin] & his wife Mathilde von Heinsberg heiress of Sommerschenburg (-6 May 1210).  
2 CONT *5.         JUDYTA (before 1154-after 12 Dec 1201).  ...  m ([1173/77]) BERNHARD von Ballenstedt Graf von Aschersleben und Anhalt, son of ALBRECHT Markgraf von Brandenburg [Ballenstedt] & his wife Sophie von Winzenburg (1140-Bernb
2 CONC urg 9 Feb 1212, bur Ballenstedt St Nikolai) ... Prince Mieszko & his second wife had five children: 
2 CONT *6.         BOLESŁAW (1159-13 Sep 1195).  ...  m ([1187/89]) --- von Pommern, daughter of BOGISLAW I Duke of Pomerania & his first wife Walburgis --- ([1162/72]-[1220/26] or after). ... Prince Bolesław & his wife had [three] child
2 CONC ren:  
2 CONT ** ... 
2 CONT *7.         MIESZKO ([1160/65]-2 Aug 1193).  ... Prince of Kalisch. 
2 CONT *8.         WŁADYSŁAW ([1161/67]-3 Nov 1231).  ... m (before 1195) [LUCIA] von Rügen, daughter of JAROMIR [I] [Fürst von Rügen] & his wife --- (-19 Feb after 1208). 
2 CONT *9.         SALOMEA (-11 May <nowiki>----</nowiki>).  ... m (before 1177) RATIBOR von Pommern, son of BOGISLAW I Duke of Pomerania & his first wife Walburgis --- ([1160]-14/15 Jan 1183, bur Stolp).
2 CONT *10.      ANASTASIA (before 1164-after 31 May 1240).  ... m (26 Apr 1177) as his second wife, BOGISLAW I Duke of Pomerania, son of WARTISLAW I Duke of Pomerania & his wife --- ([1130]-18 Mar 1187). 
