2 CONC  frater" when recording his marriage[1926].  Graf von Laufen 1067.  m as her first husband, IDA von Werl, daughter of BERNHARD von Werl Graf von Hövel & his wife ---.  The Annalista Saxo names Ida daughter of "Bernhardus comes", h
