2 CONT **B1. Miklós, Palatine (1275)+(1276-77)+(1284-86)+(1289)+(1291)+(1293-95), Bán of Slavonia (1277-78)+(1279-80), Magister pincernarum (Pohárnokmester), Obergespan of Zala, Sopron, Pozsony and Somogy, +1299
