1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Parents also seen as https://www.geni.com/people/NN-de-Chaources-seigneur-de-Chaources-Sourches/6000000113855505821?through=6000000113769642944 & https://www.geni.com/people/NN-mother-of-Helene-Maria-de-Chaources/60000001138558748
