1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HENRI II Duke of Brabant.   (c1207-Louvain 1/2 Feb 1248, bur Villers). 
2 CONT s/o  HENRI I "le Guerroyeur" Duke of Brabant & Mathilde de Flandre 
2 CONT x <22 Aug 1215 MARIA von Staufen, d/o PHILIPP King of Germany Duke of Swabia & Maria née Eirene Angelina of Byzantium ([1199/1200]-Louvain before 1235). 
2 CONT 1.         MATHILDE de Brabant (1224-29 Sep 1288, bur Abbey of Cercamp, Artois).  
2 CONT 2.         BEATRIX de Brabant (1225-11 Nov 1288, bur Abbaye de Marquette, near Lille). 
2 CONT 3.         HENRI de Brabant (-Louvain 28 Feb or 1 Mar 1261, bur Leeuwen Dominican 
2 CONT 4.         MARIE de Brabant (-beheaded Donauwörth 18 Jan 1256, bur Donauwörth Heilige Kreuz-Stift). 
2 CONT 5.         MARGUERITE de Brabant (-[4 Jun] 1277)
2 CONT 6.         PHILIPPE de Brabant (-young, bur Leeuwen St Pieter).  
2 CONT xx  (1241) SOPHIE von Thüringen, d/o LUDWIG IV "der Heilige" Landgraf of Thuringia & Erszébet of Hungary (Wartburg 20 Mar 1224-[Marburg] 29 May 1275, bur Villers).
2 CONT 1. ELISABETH de Brabant (1243-17 Apr or 9 Oct 1261, bur Braunschweig)
2 CONT 2. HENRI de Brabant (24 Jun 1244-Marburg 21 Dec 1308, bur Marburg Elisabethkirche)
