2 CONT Child 4: , Leonor, b. ABT 1256
2 CONT Child 5: , Sancho_IV_the_Fierce of Castile, King of Castile & LeÃn, b. 12MAY 1258
2 CONT Child 6: , Constanza, b. ABT 1259
2 CONT Child 7: , Pedro of Castile, sn de Ledesma, b. BEF JUN 1261
2 CONT Child 8: , Juan of Castile, Infant of Castile, b. BEF APR 1264
2 CONT Child 9: , Isabel, b. ABT 1265
