2 CONT * https://familypedia.wikia.org/wiki/Euphemia_of_Troppau_(c1320-1352)/descendants
2 CONT * https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p642.htm
2 CONT * http://bolindkvist.se/register.php?personID=I90548&tree=tree1&generations=
