2 CONT >12.      '''LENGVENIS [Lingweni] ([1355]-after 19 Jun 1431).  Prince of Mstislavsk.  He was baptised SZYMON in 1386.  "…Symeonis alias Ligwen Sigismundi germani fratris ducis Wytawdi…" subscribed the charter dated 1411 under whic
