2 CONT   Valdemar III the Young (1209 - 1231)
2 CONT   Erik Plovpenning (1216 - 1259)**
2 CONT    Abel of Denmark (1218 - 1252)**
2 CONT    Christopher I (1219 - 1259)**
2 CONT
