2 CONT Thanks to his marriage with Hedwig of Hesse he obtained the rule over an extensive heritage, after the death of his father-in-law, earl Giso IV, which lead to the union of Thuringia and Hesse. In 1137 Ludwig became as well Landgra
2 CONC f of Hesse-Gudensberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT His close relationship to the King Lothair III favoured his rise into the rank of a prince. After the death of Lothair, in 1137, Ludwig decided to support the Hohenstaufen in their struggle for power in the Reich against the Welf 
