2 CONT 1137-48 Sovereign Countess Hedwig von Gudensberg of Gudensberg-Orlamünde and Arnshaugh 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1140-44 Regent Dowager Margravine of Thüringen (Germany)  
2 CONT
2 CONT Only daughter and heir of Count Giso IV and Kunigunde von Bilstein. Her husband, Landgrave Ludwig von Thüringen died in 1128 and four weeks later she gave birth to their son Ludwig II. 12 years later he was given the fief of Thüri
2 CONC ngen by King Konrad III with her in charge of the regency. She lived (ca. 1110-48). 
