2 NOTE ..I didn't think it was useful to specify, but obviously the much vaunted "link to the research of the doctor of historical sciences" by the very kind new Cyrillic user #1st commentator above, has been treated in the appropriate d
3 CONC iscussion, and just as the JPG supposed and suggested to "workers in progress" it was soon cut and deleted exactly by the Russian (C) himself Cyrillic :D 
2 NOTE this JPG actually has hundreds of TAGGED profiles, mysteriously hidden since 2022.
3 CONT So not only was it a useful visual cue to work on a disaster zone (along with other JPGs), not only a slight notification that there is work in progress, but it was also a useful placeholder for places to go back to work. (Mysteri
3 CONC ously hidden since 2022 :) 
