1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mechtild von Sternberg, daughter of Hoyer I, Graf von Sternberg1,2 d. a 1299 and Agnes zur Lippe1,2 d. a 1307, married Sir Friedrich 'the Younger' von Dorstadt, son of Konrad von Dorstadt and Gertrud von Amersleben; They had 4 son
2 CONC s (Sir Konrad; Friedrich; Walter; & Burchard) & 1 daughter (Adelheid, wif of Hermann von Schermcke, of (Mr.) van der Asseburg-Lechede; & of Jordan von Neindorf).1,2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Friedrich 'the Younger' von Dorstadt died after 1306.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Mechtild von Sternberg died after 1316.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
