1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Kunegunda Łokietkówna''' – '''polska królewna''' i '''księżna świdnicka'''. [http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kunegunda_%C5%81okietk%C3%B3wna Wikipedia PL]
2 CONT
2 CONT Kunigarde of Poland (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #40904, d. 1331
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=2 Sep 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.23%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Kunigarde of Poland was the daughter of Wladislaw I, King of Poland and Hedwig Piast. (1) She married, firstly, Bernard of Swidnica , Duke of Swidnica before 1312. (1) She married, secondly, Rudolf I Herzog von Sachsen-Witten
2 CONC berg, son of Albrecht II Herzog von Sachsen and Agnes von Habsburg, in 1328. (1) She died in 1331. She was also reported to have died in 1337. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Kunigarde of Poland was also known as Margarete-Kunigunde of Poland.
2 CONT
