1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne von Sachsen
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #7338, b. before 1276, d. circa 1440
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Anne von Sachsen was born before 1276. She was the daughter of Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen and Cecilia di Carrara. She married, firstly, Friedrich Herzog von Braunschweig, son of Magnus II Herzog von Braunschweig and Cathe
2 CONC rine von Anhalt-Bernburg, circa 1386. She married, secondly, Balthazar Markgraf von Meißen, son of Friedrich II Markgraf von Meißen and Mathilde von Wittelsbach, on 14 July 1404 at Sangerhausen, Germany. She died circa 1440.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Anne von Sachsen and Friedrich Herzog von Braunschweig
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Catherine von Braunschweig+ d. b 26 Nov 1439
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Anne von Braunschweig+ d. 11 Aug 1432
2 CONT
