2 CONT
2 CONT By his marriage (1304) to Elisabeth of Austria (1285-1352), daughter of Albert I of Austria the Emperor, he had the following issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT Rudolph (1320-1346), his successor in Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret, married Jean de Chalon, lord of Auberive (d.1350), then Conrad, count of Friburg, and lastly Ulrich (d.1377), lord of Rappoltstein
