2 CONC burg)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ruled Saxony jointly with his Uncle Albert 2nd and brother Albert 3rd and John the 2nd, until he was of age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Saxony is partitioned into Saxe-Lauenburg and Saxe-Wittemberg 9- 20- 1296.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries in 1316 or 1318.
