0 @N6000000002322337394@ NOTE This "son" will represent the unknown number of sons there were. It will also
1 CONT represent a particular son who would be the father of Yaroslav's grandson,
1 CONT Vladimir II Monomachus, the next ruler. When Yaroslav died, the empire was
1 CONT divided amonst his sons, who, in time, divided the empire amonst their sons,
1 CONT with the end result of having Russia becoming a group of petty states almost
1 CONT continually at war with one another. One final attempt was made by Vladimir II
1 CONT to unite the country, or Empire.
