1 CONT 2. Cunigunde of Hohenstaufen (1200-1248), married King Wenceslaus I, King of Bohemia
1 CONT 3. Marie of Hohenstaufen (1201-1235), married Henry II, Duke of Brabant
1 CONT 4. Elisabeth of Hohenstaufen (1203-1235), married King Ferdinand III of Castile
