1 CONT [edit] Family and children
1 CONT He married Elisabeth of Bavaria-Landshut (1383–13 November 1442, Ansbach), daughter of Duke Frederick of Bavaria-Landshut and Maddalena Visconti. Their children were:
1 CONT
1 CONT John "the Alchemist". 
1 CONT Frederick II. 
1 CONT Albrecht Achilles. 
1 CONT Frederick "the Fat" (c. 1424–6 October 1463, Tangermünde). 
1 CONT Elisabeth (1403–31 October 1449, Liegnitz), married: 
1 CONT in Konstanz c. 1420 Duke Ludwig II of Liegnitz and Brieg; 
1 CONT c. 1438 Duke Wenzel I of Teschen. 
1 CONT Cäcilie (c. 1405–4 January 1449), married in Berlin 30 May 1423 Duke Wilhelm I of Braunschweig-Lüneburg. 
1 CONT Margarete (1410–27 July 1465, Landshut), married: 
1 CONT in 1423 to Duke Albrecht V of Mecklenburg; 
1 CONT in Ingolstadt 20 July 1441 to Louis VIII, Duke of Bavaria; 
1 CONT in 1446 to Martin von Waldenfels. 
1 CONT Magdalene (c. 1412 –27 October 1454, Scharnebeck), married in Tangermünde 3 July 1429 to Duke Friedrich of Braunschweig-Lüneburg. 
1 CONT Sofie, born and died 1417. 
1 CONT Dorothea (9 February 1420–19 January 1491, Rehna), married 1432 to Duke Heinrich IV of Mecklenburg-Schwerin. 
1 CONT
