0 @N6000000002187656140@ NOTE Marquis Dietrich II of Niederlausitz
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopediah
1 CONT
1 CONT Marquis Dietrich II of Niederlausitz born c.989 and died November 19, 1034. Married Princess Mathilde of Meissen. Son of Dedo I Merseburg and Thietberga of Nordmark. [1][2]
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] References
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. ^ http://worldconnect.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=mila52&id=I0211
