1 CONT his rival, Philip of Swabia, after Philip's death, in order to retain support
1 CONT of at least part of the Hohenstaufen faction, but lost that support when she
1 CONT died within three weeks of their marriage. In alliances with his uncle, King
1 CONT John of England, he invaded France which supported Frederick. Disastrously
1 CONT defeated at the Battle of Bouvines in 1214, he was deserted & deposed, 1215.
