1 CONT to play the role as prince consort, he was, nevertheless, regarded as a
1 CONT foreigner and had to come to terms with a queen who had the prerogartive of
1 CONT acting in her own right. Not until the queen died did he become the leading
1 CONT personality in Poland, ruling thereafter as true King of Poland, to 1434.
0 @N6000000002244410715@ NOTE In 1362-63, his father campaigned in the territories of the Tatars, defeating
1 CONT three of their governors in the battle at the River Siniye Vody, securing the
1 CONT principality of Kiev, which he gave to his son, Vladimir.
0 @N6000000002322320588@ NOTE Korybut, of of 12 sons of Algirdas and brother to King Wladyslaw II Jagiello,
1 CONT he was an ancestor of a future king of Poland, Michael Wishniowiecki.
