1 CONT
1 CONT and after her branch, Margaret II of Denmark, granddaughter of Alexandrine of Mecklenburg
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT These are heirs-general of Eric, Duke of Sudermannia, and Duke Skule of Norway and Ingeborg of Denmark, Queen of Norway and the two Swedish ladies as ancestresses of House of Mecklenburg.
1 CONT
