1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Life
1 CONT He was a son of duke Otto II and Agnes. Her grandfathers were duke Henry the Lion and the Hohenstaufen Conrad. When the Wittelsbach country was divided in 1255 among Otto's sons, Louis received the Palatinate and Upper Bavaria; hi
1 CONC s brother Henry XIII received Lower Bavaria.
