1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Family and children
1 CONT He was married three times. Louis stabbed his first wife Mary of Brabant due to wrong accusations of adultery in Donauwörth 1256. As expiation he founded Fürstenfeldbruck monastery. Second, he married 1260 Anna of Glogau and had t
1 CONC he following children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Maria (b. 1261), nun in cloister Marienburg. 
1 CONT Ludwig (13 September 1267–23 November 1290, killed at a tournament at Nuremberg. 
1 CONT Third, he married 27 October 1273 Mechthild, one of king Rudolph's daughters. They children were:
1 CONT
1 CONT Agnes (ca. 1267/77–1345), married to: 
