0 @N6000000002322312649@ NOTE During the ongoing war between two kings of Germany, his brother Frederick
1 CONT being one of the rivals, Frederick was finally defeated by Louis IV on
1 CONT September, 28, 1322, at Muhldorf in Bararia and was imprisoned in the castle
1 CONT of Trausnitz (Upper Palatinate). In March 1325 he was freed after taking an
1 CONT oath to recognize Louis as king and to see to it that his brother Leopold did
1 CONT so too. When he proved unable to do so he returned voluntarily to prison.
1 CONT After Leopold's death in 1326, Frederick's power was limited to Austria.
